// ProtoText's WriteUnknown panics where it's called for bytes that aren't fields as a reader
// keeps them: here, a length of 5 bytes with only 1 after it.
Import std.core
Import std.data.protobuf

Local text = ProtoText()
text.WriteUnknown([8, 1])
Print(text.Finish())
text.WriteUnknown([8, 1, 10, 5, 65])
Print("unreachable {text.Finish()}")
